{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_0_0_welcome_to_guide",
  "groupId": "main_0",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "序章·上",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/guide/beg/0_welcome_to_guide.txt",
  "sourceHash": "85dd91f39dedd832a5def5432b0d90c31af1b370dbea01fe347bdc9c2c43f404",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "初始引导\n哦，是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "離我們上一次見面，已經過去了很久。\n這段時間裡......你一直徘徊在懸崖的邊緣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你可能已經忘記了你的身份，但你還記得那個名字，這就夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——好了，別在這裡逗留太久。\n畢竟，你既不是我的客人，也不應該出現在這裡。\n她需要你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "12月23日。\n你可能記不清這一天對你來說，究竟意味著什麼。\n這會讓你陷入十分危險的處境。\n......\n不。\n你必須想起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......知覺......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開始迴圈............阻升主......停跳液注入完成......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......體溫過低............海克塞米松20cc，靜推。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "止血鉗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......狀態正常......開始切除......注意室顫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又讓你受苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": ".......手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓......緊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓緊我的手！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "緊急......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......救......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......束了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，博士他還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才，剛才博士......明明已經拉住我的手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是到現在，博士都沒有清醒......怎麼辦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭！別那麼著急，稍微冷靜點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......抱，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一遇到和博士有關的事情，你就變得慌慌張張的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只不過，阿米婭，如果博士還是.....你該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我做好心理準備了。就像我們之前說的那樣做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道了。就按你說的做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就......拜託你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那博士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧阿米婭，博士的狀況已經穩定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再檢查一次好了，包在我身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就......拜託你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。呼吸比較微弱，血壓正常。應該不要緊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你醒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，成功了，博士清醒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，太好了......博士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，小心！你現在還不能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先別動，你的身體還沒有完全適應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你們......是誰？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——博士——我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們是來救你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......我是......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和我們一樣，也是“羅德島”組織的一員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是我的同伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——Dr.{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是我，最重要的同伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......不記得了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......我真的能相信你嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我知道。我知道這對於博士你來說很難接受。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我沒有奢望你現在就能回憶起過去，也不會要求你現在就信任我。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "難道說，Dr.{@nickname}也不記得我了......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "就算是這樣......我也不會放棄的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我們為了找到你，已經付出了很多很多......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "是嗎......初次見面，阿米婭。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "啊，你，你好。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "不，我不是......我不知道該怎麼說......很多事情都不再是以前那樣了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "就連我，肯定也變得和過去不一樣......"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少，對我來說，博士始終是我最重要的人。無論發生什麼事，這一點是不會改變的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，請你.....請你多給我一點時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕只是一小段時間......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士真的......失憶了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，如果，這樣能給博士一點空間的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這裡到底是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒？發生了什————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "全副武裝的男性",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，有情況！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "全副武裝的男性",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人闖進了設施！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "全副武裝的男性",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們的打扮......不是烏薩斯士兵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "全副武裝的男性",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們想幹什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "全副武裝的男性",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敵襲！阿米婭，敵人裝備了重火力兵器！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔唔唔唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家注意！利用掩體，保護好博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這打扮難道是......整合運動？怎麼會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "近衛人員......做好戰鬥準備！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惡，這些傢伙是衝著博士來的嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......博士的存在不會有別人知道才對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生的遠端通訊呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道為什麼，設備停止工作了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有什麼切斷了我們之間的通訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏薩斯政府發現了我們的行蹤嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在要怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原本負責這次行動的凱爾希醫生，現在沒辦法參與指揮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————Dr.{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————我希望，由博士來指揮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這......會不會太冒險了，博士才剛剛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我想......試一試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然失去了記憶，但博士確實曾與我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一同戰鬥過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你教會了我這麼多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們一起經歷了許多許多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道的......博士你能為我們帶來勝利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能為我們帶來勝利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我明白這樣突然請求你很失禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，但是......拜託了，請你助我們一臂之力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也會輔助你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那就先打退他們！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們只能反擊了，是嗎？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我也不想再把博士你捲入這些紛爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但現在的我們，非常需要Dr.{@nickname}的智慧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望博士能在戰鬥中，把過去的感覺找回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————也許連你自己都可能還不太相信......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我相信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我相信你，一定可以的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請指揮————羅德島！"
    },
